---
import BaseLayout from'../../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Breadcrumbs from'../../../../components/Breadcrumbs.astro';
import LearningSection from'../../../../components/LearningSection.astro';
import Grade7Unit1CompletionCheck from'../../../../components/Grade7Unit1CompletionCheck.astro';
import{grade7Unit1CompletionCheckBank,unit1CompletionCoverage}from'../../../../data/grade7Unit1Completion';
const base=import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---
<BaseLayout title="Unit 1 Independent Check | Grade 7 Math" description="Independent randomized Unit 1 assessment for Coordinates and Design." themeColor="#2457c5"><div class="completion-page"><Breadcrumbs items={[{label:'Home',href:base},{label:'Grade 7 Math',href:`${base}courses/grade-7-math/`},{label:'Coordinates and Design'},{label:'Unit Check'}]}/><header class="hero"><p class="eyebrow">GRADE 7 MATH · UNIT 1 COMPLETION</p><h1>Independent <span>Unit Check</span></h1><p>This is assessment, not guided practice. Complete the full randomized attempt before any correctness, answer, or explanation appears.</p><div class="sequence" aria-label="Unit completion sequence"><a href="../horizontal-vertical-distances/">1.4 Lesson</a><a href="../unit-review/">Unit Review</a><strong aria-current="step">Unit Check</strong><a href="../math-arcade/">Math Arcade</a></div></header>
<LearningSection id="architecture" eyebrow="HOW THE CHECK WORKS" title="Balanced, independent evidence" icon="🧭" tone="idea"><div class="architecture"><article><strong>12 questions per attempt</strong><p>Exactly three questions come from each of Lessons 1.1–1.4.</p></article><article><strong>3 / 6 / 3 difficulty</strong><p>Three foundational, six core, and three reasoning questions are selected on every attempt.</p></article><article><strong>Balanced answer positions</strong><p>Every attempt places exactly three correct answers in each of A, B, C, and D.</p></article><article><strong>Delayed feedback</strong><p>All 12 must be answered before scoring, explanations, and repair links appear.</p></article></div><p class="scope"><strong>Scope:</strong> {unit1CompletionCoverage.map(x=>`Lesson ${x.lesson} ${x.title}`).join(' · ')}. The bank is separate from lesson Check Yourself banks and from Unit Review practice.</p></LearningSection>
<LearningSection id="check" eyebrow="INDEPENDENT ASSESSMENT" title="Generate a fresh Unit 1 attempt" icon="✅" tone="review"><Grade7Unit1CompletionCheck bank={grade7Unit1CompletionCheckBank}/></LearningSection>
<LearningSection id="boundary" eyebrow="SCOPE GUARD" title="Coordinate mathematics stays inside Unit 1" icon="🛡️" tone="review"><p>The check assesses ordered pairs, axes/quadrants, coordinate designs, translation/reflection/rotation, image notation, corresponding vertices, successive transformations, horizontal/vertical movement and distance, and route comparison. It does not introduce diagonal-distance formulas, Pythagorean distance, slope, vectors, or mapping-rule algebra.</p></LearningSection>
<LearningSection id="next" eyebrow="NEXT" title="Transfer the mathematics in Math Arcade" icon="🎮" tone="play"><p>When your result says <strong>Ready for transfer</strong>, use the Festival Grid mission to apply the unit in a non-quiz environment. If a lesson score is weak, use the generated repair links first.</p><div class="next-actions"><a href="../unit-review/">← Unit Review</a><a class="primary" href="../math-arcade/">Open Math Arcade →</a></div></LearningSection></div></BaseLayout>
<style>
.completion-page{max-width:1180px;margin:auto;padding:1rem}.hero{padding:2rem 0 2.5rem}.eyebrow{font-size:.76rem;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:.08em;color:#607087}.hero h1{font-size:clamp(2.45rem,7vw,4.8rem);line-height:.98;margin:.35rem 0}.hero h1 span{display:block;color:#2457c5}.sequence{display:flex;gap:.45rem;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:1rem}.sequence a,.sequence strong{padding:.5rem .65rem;border-radius:999px;background:#eef3f9;color:#244260;text-decoration:none}.sequence strong{background:#2457c5;color:#fff}.architecture{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:.75rem}.architecture article{padding:.9rem;border:1px solid #d7e1ee;border-radius:12px;background:#fff}.architecture strong{font-size:1.05rem}.scope{padding:.75rem;border-left:4px solid #2457c5;background:#eef6ff}.next-actions{display:flex;gap:.7rem;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center}.next-actions a{padding:.7rem .85rem;border-radius:9px;font-weight:850;color:#174ea6}.next-actions .primary{background:#2457c5;color:#fff;text-decoration:none}.completion-page :focus-visible{outline:3px solid #ea8c00;outline-offset:3px}@media(max-width:700px){.architecture{grid-template-columns:1fr}}@media(max-width:390px){.completion-page{padding:.7rem}.hero h1{font-size:clamp(2.15rem,11vw,3rem)}}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.completion-page *{animation:none!important;transition:none!important;scroll-behavior:auto!important}}
</style>
